        "TileImage": "$($repository 0afcc59e-6d6e-433f-8404-7699df872c9d).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rHaven Island. A private paradise where the wealthy come to disappear, reinvent themselves, and leave their troubles behind.\r\rUnfortunately for our client, three individuals have made this island their sanctuary—and someone wants that sanctuary destroyed.\r\rYour task is to eliminate the designated targets and leave the island without raising suspicion.\r\rEnjoy your stay, 47.\r\rParadise awaits.",
